            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "玻璃基板進入量產關鍵期！三星、英特爾、藍思競逐TGV  良率與客戶認證成勝負關鍵",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"玻璃基板進入量產關鍵期！三星、英特爾、藍思競逐TGV  良率與客戶認證成勝負關鍵\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5f73c63fda268509b082bb807d3cd0f5bfcfa033ec56174bc8af45739fd652af/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F137663e567496b08d97428aa8c625a0f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">玻璃基板進入量產關鍵期！三星、英特爾、藍思競逐TGV  良率與客戶認證成勝負關鍵</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%8E%BB%E7%92%83%E5%9F%BA%E6%9D%BF%E9%80%B2%E5%85%A5%E9%87%8F%E7%94%A2%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5%E6%9C%9F-%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F-%E8%8B%B1%E7%89%B9%E7%88%BE-%E8%97%8D%E6%80%9D%E7%AB%B6%E9%80%90tgv-%E8%89%AF%E7%8E%87%E8%88%87%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B6%E8%AA%8D%E8%AD%89%E6%88%90%E5%8B%9D%E8%B2%A0%E9%97%9C%E9%8D%B5-111002741.html",
