        {
            "title": "比特幣在國債收益率下滑引發挾淡倉後，守穩77,000美元上方",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"比特幣在國債收益率下滑引發挾淡倉後，守穩77,000美元上方\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/289036f85973ecaed331aba5b2e04f718c182334e7530348c9d5f26504d6ced4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPED9G1CM_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">比特幣在國債收益率下滑引發挾淡倉後，守穩77,000美元上方</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 據CoinDesk及CNBC報道，比特幣週六交投於77,000美元略上方，此前曾一度逼近80,000美元，但隨後回吐部分升幅。市場正在評估此次由美國國債市場帶動的挾淡倉行情，究竟是持續復甦的開端，還是短暫反彈。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">比特幣週五最高觸及79,200美元，其後回落至77,500美元附近。美國財政部宣布將長期國債回購規模從每次20億美元提升至40億美元，此消息推動了本輪漲勢加速。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-81897784-1cc3-3dd4-a6ec-ecaa9ce5213b-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間上午5:50（北京時間17:50），比特幣下跌1.115%，報77,025.1美元。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">受上述消息影響，30年期國債收益率從19年高位5.34%回落至約5.19%，緩解了風險資產所承受的壓力。由於比特幣不產生利息收入，高企的國債收益率一直與比特幣競爭資金流入。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">財政部的國債回購計劃旨在改善舊債券的流動性，並優化政府債務的結構組成。分析師強調，該計劃並非量化寬鬆——後者涉及聯儲局創造儲備金以購買資產，兩者性質不同。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">國債收益率的下滑觸發了加密貨幣空倉的快速平倉潮。週四及週五兩天內，約40億美元的空倉遭到清算，此前比特幣已突破多個阻力位，並站上200日移動平均線（約69,000美元）。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">高槓桿倉位進一步放大了漲幅。據CoinDesk引用的數據顯示，幣安（Binance）在某60秒內錄得12.6億美元的比特幣期貨成交量，而隨著交易者紛紛轉向槓桿長倉，資金費率亦觸及各交易所上限。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">現貨需求同樣有所改善，美國比特幣交易所交易基金（ETF）錄得約6.5億美元的淨流入。與此同時，白宮再度向國會施壓，要求推進《CLARITY法案》——該法案旨在為數字資產建立更清晰的監管框架，此消息進一步提振了市場情緒。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">分析師對於此輪行情是否標誌著熊市終結仍存在分歧。看好後市的人士認為，挾淡倉、大陽燭以及突破重要技術位等現象，往往是市場見底的信號。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">較為謹慎的分析師則指出，比特幣需要持續的ETF資金流入以及更廣泛的貨幣寬鬆環境，才能維持升勢。他們警告，若國債收益率再度攀升，可能令此次突破受到考驗，並使槓桿長倉的持倉成本大幅上升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">交易者目前密切關注80,000美元這一關鍵阻力位。而200日移動平均線（約69,000美元）則成為衡量長期支撐的重要參考。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣行情：週六山寨幣普遍上漲</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">週六整體加密貨幣市場普遍上漲，即便比特幣略有回落。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第二大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣（Ether）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣（Ether）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣（Ether）</a>上漲0.76%，報2,420.39美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第三大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>上漲5.2%，報1.4967美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>上漲2.2%，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"BNB\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:BNB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/bnb/bnb-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BNB</a>則上漲2.77%，報696.93美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此外，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"卡爾達諾（Cardano）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:卡爾達諾（Cardano）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/cardano/ada-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">卡爾達諾（Cardano）</a>大漲4.50%，報0.2253美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣（Dogecoin）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣（Dogecoin）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣（Dogecoin）</a>飆升7.21%，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/official-trump/trumpo-usd?cid=1225641?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TRUMP</a>則大漲41.40%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%AF%94%E7%89%B9%E5%B9%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%8B%E5%82%B5%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8B%E6%BB%91%E5%BC%95%E7%99%BC%E6%8C%BE%E6%B7%A1%E5%80%89%E5%BE%8C-%E5%AE%88%E7%A9%A977-000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E4%B8%8A%E6%96%B9-105207243.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-22 19:05:20",
